			"• ピカちん大百科とは、番組内でこんな時こんなモノがあったらいいのになぁ～！という欲望から生まれる「ちょっとした１％のひらめき＝ピラメキ」をキャッチしてピカちんキットを生み出してくれる発明品！",
			"• ピカちんキットを組み立てるための７つ道具がついているぞ！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• Your invention starts here!",
			"• The Pikachin Encyclopedia that appears on the TV program \"Pochitto Invention Pikachin Kit\" has been commercialized!",
			"• What is Pikachin Encyclopedia? I wish there was something like this at times like this in the program! An invention that captures the \"little 1% inspiration = piramaki\" born from that desire and creates Pikachin Kit!",
			"• Comes with 7 tools to assemble Pikachin Kit!"
		]
